        <h2>Rover Journey Portal</h2>
        <h3 class="hidden-sm hidden-xs">Self-directed. Encompassing. Independent.</h3>
        <h4 class="hidden-sm hidden-xs">Welcome to the Rover Journey! You can view the available Rover Journey Modules and submit your tier reports through the links below!</h4>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-4 col-md-offset-4">
