</div>
<div class="container">
    <div class="section text-center">
        <div class="page-header"><h2>The Rover Journey</h2></div>
        <h3 class="visible-sm visible-xs">Self-directed. Encompassing. Independent.</h3>
        <h4 class="visible-sm visible-xs">Welcome to the Rover Journey! Within this portal lies an interactive programme for Rover Scouts embarking on their adventure through Rovering. Here you will be spoilt for choices as you choose from the wide range of activities to do in and around Singapore!</h4>
        <h3>Why?</h3>
        <h4>The Rover Journey aims to provide a <strong>holistic</strong> and <strong>comprehensive</strong> guide for Rovers to experience a challenging and enriching journey of Scouting.</h4>
        <h3>What?</h3>
        <h4>The Rover Journey comprises of 2 award schemes, <strong>Rover Milestones</strong> &amp; <strong>Personal Masteries</strong>, that recognises progression in personal development and expertise in various domains respectively.</h4>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <h3>Rover Milestones</h3>
                <img src="/img/RoverJourney/RoverMilestones.png" alt="Rover Milestones">
                <h4>The Rover Miles provides a flexible modular system which a Rover can pursue in accordance to his/her interest and capabilities. 5 domains have been established with a non-exhaustive repertoire of activities.</h4>
            </div> <!-- /.col-md-6 -->
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <h3>Personal Masteries</h3>
                <img src="/img/RoverJourney/PersonalMasteries.jpg" alt="Personal Masteries">
                <h4>The Rover Journey encourages Rovers to pursue their areas of interest and attain a high level of expertise and experience in these areas.</h4>
                <h4>The Rover Journey acknowledges unique skill sets and expertise afforded by Rovers which is beneficial to both Scouting and his life.</h4>
            </div> <!-- /.col-md-6 -->
        </div> <!-- ./row -->
    </div>
    <div class="page-header"><h2 class="text-center">The 5 Domains</h2></div>
</div>
<div class="banner-container" id="RJFellowshipBanner">
    <div class="banner-text">
        <h2 class="text-center">Fellowship</h2>
        <h4>Take on the Rover Journey as you explore the world through its people and experience the vast cultures and traditions practiced both at home and abroad. Understand the world better through learning the history and heritage of different countries and take this chance to travel and immerse yourself in intercultural experiences which will not just be fun and eye-opening but will also strengthen bonds within a community. Embrace the fellowship of Rovering as you learn a new religion, explore different cultures, retrace Singapore's heritage as well as appreciating experiencing life in another country.</h4>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="banner-container" id="RJOpenAirBanner">
    <div class="banner-text">
        <h2 class="text-center">Open Air</h2>
        <h4>Take a deep breath and take a leap of faith as you embark on a series of adventurous activities within the Rover Journey. Seek new thrills and get your adrenaline pumping as you set yourself on activities such as Diving, Climbing, Wakeboarding and Bungee Jumping. We are sure you will find like-minded Rovers who are just as out-going and crazy about the life in the outdoors. In the spirit of Open Air, go on an expedition of a lifetime, step out of your comfort zone and just have lots of fun!</h4>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="banner-container" id="RJServiceCitizenshipBanner">
    <div class="banner-text">
        <h2 class="text-center">Service &amp; Citizenship</h2>
        <h4>A daily good turn a day, makes the world a better place. If you're seeking a chance to serve those around you, this Rover Journey is just for you. Explore the many ways you can make the community and this world a better place through dedicating your time in different areas of service! Take this chance to promote active citizenship as you embark on experiences that makes you uniquely Singaporean!</h4>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="banner-container" id="RJRoveringSuccessBanner">
    <div class="banner-text">
        <h2 class="text-center">Rovering to Success</h2>
        <h4>Take your first step to success as you gather knowledge and skills to equip you with the right tools to transit into adulthood. The Rover Journey exposes you to an array of activities and courses which you can undertake to learn new skillsets as well as reinforce the knowledge and expertise that you already have. What are you waiting for, grab this opportunity and be the very best!</h4>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="banner-container" id="RJBackScoutingBanner">
    <div class="banner-text">
        <h2 class="text-center">Back to Scouting</h2>
        <h4>Good ol' days! Experience Scouting as a Rover at its most basic form. Get cooking, build a structure, go camping! Take this chance to lead the young ones on a Scouting journey they will never forget. Take on leadership positions within the unit, craft programmes for the scouts and impart your knowledge to the young ones, get them to realise their potential!</h4>
    </div>
</div>
